&gt;&gt; Jesse: WHERE IS TONY DANCER

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:10.109
WHEN YOU NEED HIM?

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:10.876
ALYSSA MILANO PROTESTING AT THE

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:13.145
GEORGIA CAPITAL AGAINST THE

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:14.580
