00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.407
&gt;&gt; I WORK IN GEORGIA.

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:42.675
&gt;&gt; DO YOU VOTE IN GEORGIA?

00:00:42.676 --> 00:00:46.312
STICK I DON'T.

00:00:46.313 --> 00:00:48.347
THERE ARE 30 PEOPLE OUTSIDE THE

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:50.482
TO VOTE IN GEORGIA.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:55.988
DON'T INTERRUPT ME.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.157
THE PEOPLE THAT WORK ON MY

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:01.093
CRUISE, THE PEOPLE IN THE

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:03.095
ENTERTAINMENT INDUSTRY EMPLOYED

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.296
DO.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:07.900
VOTING ON WHAT WAS INSIDE THE

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:11.837
BILL.

