&gt;&gt; Kennedy: SHE HAS CREATED A

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:13.939
WHOLE COTTAGE INDUSTRY FOR

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.273
HERSELF.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:17.743
SHE IS THE ANNOYING POLICE.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:18.043
JESSE.

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:20.279
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I WANT TO MAKE SOME

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:20.679
DISCLOSURE.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.413
I HAVE A CONFLICT OF INTEREST

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.415
WITH THE STORY.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.050
ALYSSA MILANO WAS MY CRUSH WHEN

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:26.518
I WAS GROWING UP AND I LOVED HER

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.454
ON "FULL HOUSE."

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:32.791
I THOUGHT SAMANTHA WAS FANTASTIC

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:33.592
FOR HER.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:36.195
I ALSO HAD A CRUSH ON LORI

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:39.932
LOUGHLIN.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.633
IT'S HARD FOR ME TO COMMENT ON

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.736
PEOPLE ALL HAD A CRUSH ON WHEN I

00:01:43.737 --> 00:01:45.170
WAS A SIX OR SEVEN OR 8-YEAR-OLD

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:46.772
BOY BUT I'M GOING TO DO IT

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.741
ANYWAY BECAUSE THIS IS

00:01:48.742 --> 00:01:49.408
"THE FIVE."

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:51.377
I AM NOT BIASED WHEN I SAY THIS.

00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:53.579
I THINK IT'S FINE WHAT SHE'S

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:53.879
DOING.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.148
I THINK IT'S OKAY TO GO IN AND

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.684
CONFRONT POLITICIANS WHERE THEY

00:01:58.685 --> 00:01:59.017
WORK.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:01.186
THAT'S PART OF THE DEMOCRACY.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.822
I WISH MORE PEOPLE DID THAT.

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:05.457
I WISH MORE PEOPLE DID IT ON THE

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:06.325
OTHER SIDE OF COURSE, BUT SHE

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:09.128
HAS EVERY RIGHT TO GO IN THERE

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:11.597
AND RAISE HELL.

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:13.599
I THOUGHT SHE WAS KIND OF RUDE

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.900
WHEN SHE SAID DON'T INTERRUPT

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:15.167
ME.

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:16.402
I DON'T THINK SHE NEEDED TO DO

00:02:16.403 --> 00:02:17.636
THAT BUT I'M GOING TO GIVE HER A

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:19.238
PASS BECAUSE I LIKE HER.

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:20.973
IF ANYTHING, THIS IS GOING TO

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.808
GET HER MORE PRESS FOR HER

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:24.543
SPECIAL, WHATEVER SHE'S FILMING

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:25.010
DOWN THERE.

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.979
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: LET'S TALK ABOUT

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:27.980
THE DOLLARS AND CENTS.

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:28.714
CELEBRITIES AREN'T THE ONES WHO

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:33.419
DECIDE WERE PRODUCTION AND

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.154
WHERE SHOWS ARE FILMED.

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:36.121
STATES LIKE GEORGIA GIVE

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.489
COMPANIES LIKE NETFLIX A LOT OF

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.290
MONEY AND A LOT OF TAX BREAKS IN

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.892
ORDER TO COME AND SHOOT THERE

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.394
BECAUSE THEY HELP THE LOCAL

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:44.363
ECONOMIES.

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:45.297
&gt;&gt; Dana: YES, HOWEVER SOME

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:47.533
STATES SAY IT DOESN'T REALLY PAY

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:47.800
OFF.

00:02:47.801 --> 00:02:49.902
I THINK THESE LEGISLATURES WOULD

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:51.336
BE BETTER OFF KEEPING THEIR

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.205
TAXES LOW, MAKING SURE THAT THE

00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:54.206
GOVERNMENT RUNS EFFICIENTLY AND

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:56.008
SPENDING ALL THAT EXTRA MONEY

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.943
THAT THEY GIVE DOLLYWOOD ON

00:02:57.944 --> 00:03:00.412
ADVERTISING IN NEW ENGLAND,

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:01.947
ESPECIALLY NEWARK, NEW JERSEY,

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:05.117
CONNECTICUT, SAYING WOULDN'T YOU

00:03:05.118 --> 00:03:15.928
RATHER KEEP X AMOUNT OF

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:16.662
MONEY IN YOUR POCKETS AND LIVE

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:17.362
YOUR LIFE THE WAY YOU WANT TO

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:17.696
LIVE IT.

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:18.363
THAT'S A BETTER WAY TO SPEND

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:18.831
TAXPAYER MONEY.

00:03:18.832 --> 00:03:19.565
ENCOURAGE PEOPLE TO COME THERE.

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.098
YOU HAVE A TAX BASE.

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:20.833
NOT PEOPLE SO FICKLE WHO WANT TO

00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:21.133
LEAVE.

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:21.800
AS A REPRESENTATIVE, YOU ARE

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:22.568
VOTING THE WAY YOUR CONSTITUENTS

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:22.868
WANT.

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:23.602
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: HOW ARE THEY GOING

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:25.237
TO VOTE HERE?

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:28.640
DO CELEBRITY INPUT HAVE ANY

00:03:28.641 --> 00:03:31.243
INFLUENCE ON THE METRIC AS FAR

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:31.977
AS THIS CONVERSATION?

00:03:31.978 --> 00:03:32.945
&gt;&gt; Tom: OBVIOUSLY.

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:34.179
THEY CAN'T GET ENOUGH OF THE

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:34.813
CELEBRITIES.

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:36.081
I DON'T KNOW WIRELESS MILANO.

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:40.486
THERE ARE CERTAIN PEOPLE THAT

00:03:40.487 --> 00:03:41.220
EVERYBODY CAN'T GET ENOUGH OF.

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:43.755
I SEE HER EVERY DAY.

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:44.223
I DON'T GET IT.

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:47.693
PETE DAVIDSON.

00:03:47.694 --> 00:03:48.393
WHY IS PETE DAVIDSON AND THE

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:51.096
NEWS EVERY SINGLE DAY?

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:51.763
&gt;&gt; Kennedy: KATE BECKINSALE.

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:59.505
THERE'S AN AGE GAP.

00:03:59.506 --> 00:04:00.038
SHE'S SUPER PRETTY.

