&gt;&gt; Kennedy: JUAN, I WILL LET

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:38.477
YOU BE THE ULTIMATE REFEREE.

00:04:38.478 --> 00:04:41.046
BETWEEN JESSE AND --

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:43.382
&gt;&gt; Juan: I'M GLAD WILMA

